        "original_id": "7729d0b3-ecc4-5777-8974-1729b94c1b55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lótus Bridge, Cotai, Macau, Hengqin Island, Zhuhai, Guangdong, China\n- Systems: Cross-border road crossings, leases\n- Organizations: State Council of the People's Republic of China\n- Products: Chimelong International Ocean Resort\n\nFacts:\n- Lótus Bridge is a cross-border bridge linking the Cotai reclamation area of Macau with Hengqin Island in Zhuhai, Guangdong, China.\n- Lótus Bridge is the road crossing between mainland China and Macau.\n- Hengqin, also known in Portuguese as Ilha de Montanha, is an island in Zhuhai, Guangdong, China.\n- In 2009, the State Council of the People's Republic of China leased parts of Hengqin to Macau.\n- Chimelong International Ocean Resort is located at Hengqin in Zhuhai, China.",
